Subject: [PATCH] stories: preserve Molly story presentation and reset policy

Retain reference story visibility/query/reset behavior; no feature removal is approved by extraction.

Extract final intent, not historical commit replay. All blobs/modes in this
boundary come from untouched Molly 892d6264ba007b5458a8b74cf9183c665f1f17a1.
SOURCE ledger: e8f627b41b4358bfc78d7c410d2e5c8f12e934481682c0389750efb2bbcac00f
Feature families: MOL-STORIES-001
Dependencies: preceding cumulative extraction boundaries; validate the completed stack.
Validation: final GNU app JVM/package/lint and exact reference tree/resource/API comparison;
runtime parity and independent review remain separate parent gates.

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/org/thoughtcrime/securesms/jobs/StoryOnboardingDownloadJob.kt b/app/src/main/java/org/thoughtcrime/securesms/jobs/StoryOnboardingDownloadJob.kt
index 0f241aafd67624e8a31d00c48686fdafbbfac9ae..74e712a83dfa2b5d37706859f777e3e5d2740bbd 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/org/thoughtcrime/securesms/jobs/StoryOnboardingDownloadJob.kt
+++ b/app/src/main/java/org/thoughtcrime/securesms/jobs/StoryOnboardingDownloadJob.kt
@@ -67,6 +67,11 @@ class StoryOnboardingDownloadJob private constructor(parameters: Parameters) : B
   override fun onFailure() = Unit
 
   override fun onRun() {
+    if (!SignalStore.account.isRegistered) {
+      Log.i(TAG, "Not registered, skipping.")
+      return
+    }
+
     if (SignalStore.story.hasDownloadedOnboardingStory) {
       Log.i(TAG, "Already downloaded onboarding story. Exiting.")
       return
